  "question": "Combine the pre-task requirement state with the current client task. If the task determines a unique post-task state, choose ACT and construct that state; otherwise choose CLARIFY and identify the blocking requirement field and the question that must be answered.",
  "target_task": {
    "source_message_id": 45,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Hello Nathaniel,\nI have finally reviewed everything and checked your drawings. Please make the following changes:\n\n1\\. For POS 1+2+3, the required process differs from what I previously understood: the parts must first be premachined, then welded together, and finally machined.\n\n2\\. Use tube 168/36 as the raw material for the main shaft. Premachine it to establish the locations for POS 2+3.\n\n3\\. Place the previously unclear bushing inside the main shaft. **IMPORTANT**: my notes state this incorrectly—the bushing is not mounted to POS 4 and belongs only in the main shaft. Please select a suitable clearance between the shaft and bushing.\n\n4\\. POS 4 carries the piston/rod end and nut. The control-piston rod, which secures the sliding movement, runs inside the main shaft; therefore, the 82mm inner diameter must also be machined after welding.\n\n5\\. As indicated by cross section C-C on the main-shaft drawing, the keyway must be omitted. Make the M72x1.5 locking-nut thread wider, and increase the requested main-bushing space to 65mm.\n\n6\\. If possible, follow the numbering shown on the assembly when numbering the drawings.\n\nPlease let me know your progress, and thank you."
  },
  "history_pool": {
    "boundary": "STRICTLY_BEFORE_TARGET_MESSAGE",
    "contains_target_message": false,
    "message_count": 44,
    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Working from photographs that have the dimensions marked is actually how I complete most of my projects, so yes, of course. I would also definitely be interested in long-term cooperation.\nBest regards,\nNathaniel",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thank you for the offer. Based on the description, I could complete this first project for a fixed price of $950, with delivery estimated at 9–13 days. If that arrangement works for you, it would be my preference.\nWhat do you think?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "As some dimensions may require further clarification during the work, could you please remain available for questions and quick confirmation? I would also like you to confirm which steel grade should be used for the shaft and the other parts, and whether you have a company drawing template or any specific ČSN/EN ISO requirements.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Good evening, Mateo!\nAre we moving ahead with the project? My availability next month is quite limited, so if we are proceeding, I would like to begin as soon as possible in order to meet the agreed timeline.\nPlease let me know.\nBest regards,\nNathaniel",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Sorry for replying late. For this first project in our cooperation, would a price range of 700USD be acceptable to you?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The only template I can provide is for Autodesk Inventor, although I am not sure whether that works for you. Otherwise, I have no additional preferences; the project simply needs to comply with the usual ČSN/EN standards.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thank you for getting back to me, Mateo; no problem at all. I can accept $700 for the first project as the beginning of our cooperation.\nSome dimensional or technical points may need clarification while I work. If questions come up, I will contact you so that we can resolve them quickly and keep the project progressing.\nProvided everything goes well, I am confident there will be opportunities for us to collaborate on future projects too. Please send the fixed-price contract, and I will start immediately.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Because the part is currently in our storage, obtaining any measurements could slow my responses. Any resulting delay from my side is acceptable.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thank you for the heads-up; that is no problem. Since some measurements may take time to obtain, I'll minimize interruptions by collecting my questions and sending them together whenever possible. I look forward to working with you.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "This is the first time we've ever used this website, so we have very little experience with it. Sorry about that as well.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Everyone has to begin somewhere, Mateo, so there is no need to worry. I will make the process as smooth as I can, and you can contact me whenever you have questions about the platform.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The supplied template is from Inventor.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Our expected drawing setup is shown in this example.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Thanks in advance; please keep me informed about how the project is progressing.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 15,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thank you, I understand. Within the next 10–12 hours, I’ll begin working on the project and will keep you informed of my progress.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 16,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Please take a look at this part and clarify its intended manufacturing method. Should it be a single solid piece, or should it consist of a separate ring with 10 welded lugs? The photo shows that it is welded to the flange, but it does not reveal whether the lugs are welded onto the ring or formed integrally with it.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 17,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The assembly has now been created, but progress is blocked by incomplete and conflicting information: some dimensions are absent, several others do not agree, and the installation locations for the 7 separate parts remain unclear.\nI have compiled clarification questions and am awaiting your responses. Once I receive them, I will revise the model and send a sectional assembly view using the dimensions currently available. Additional corrections may still be necessary afterward.\nI look forward to your feedback.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 18,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Thank you for the comments. Because I am travelling to customers, my response may be delayed, but I will try to answer everything clearly as soon as possible—next Thursday or no later than Friday. Would that timing be acceptable?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 19,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "ok",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 20,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Hello, I have now tried to address all of your notes. Hopefully the clarifications help, but if any information is still missing, please contact me. Thank you.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 21,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Understood, Mateo. Next Thursday, I will review all the information, complete the necessary revisions, and prepare a preliminary drawing for you to examine.\nBest regards,\nNathaniel",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 22,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "What is the model of the sheet unwinder, please?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 23,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Could you clarify how the bushing assembly is actually put together? Several points remain unclear. I assume the 7 holes are for fastening it with screws, yet the dimensions suggest a very large interference fit: the bushing has an outer diameter of 84.6 mm, while the mating-part bore is 84 mm.\nThe countersinks appear designed to recess countersunk screw heads, but that would imply installation from the opposite side. This conflicts with the assumed arrangement.\nIn addition, the photographs omit some components from the complete shaft assembly. Consequently, the mechanism's operating principle is still not fully clear.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 24,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "For confirmation of the final dimensions, I have added all measurements obtained so far to a preview drawing; this is not the final drawing. Please either remeasure the indicated dimensions or confirm them. In the preview, the shaft is depicted fully assembled and in its fully retracted position.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 25,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "For faster communication, do you happen to use Telegram?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 26,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Could you clarify what you intended to communicate in that message?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 27,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Sorry, I don't have access.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 28,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "After the maintenance team has reviewed it with us, we will let you know their feedback.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 29,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "What is the unwinder's model, if it is commercially available?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 30,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "It is custom-made solely for local purposes, so it is not really commercially available.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 31,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "My understanding is the same. Before proceeding, I am waiting for you to verify the dimensions in the PDF I sent and explain the bushing arrangement. Its purpose is still not entirely clear; is it meant to function as a plain bearing?\nCould you also provide any photographs of the complete machine that show how the shaft was installed?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 32,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Should I also send the 3D design package immediately?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 33,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Although I am unsure whether I can obtain photographs of the machine, the 3D design file would always be welcome.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 34,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Which file format would work best for you? I think the model is otherwise basically complete; as I noted earlier, the only part I still do not understand is how the bushing should be secured.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 35,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Ideally, please provide it as .ipt; at minimum, .stp would be acceptable. Thank you.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 36,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 37,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I will proceed for now with preparing the drawings for the individual parts. The bushing and dimensions will remain pending until I receive your feedback.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 38,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Do the drawings need to specify materials? If they do, for each part, which material should be identified?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 39,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Except for the bushing, please specify S355 JRG2 as the standard material for every part for now. The bushing should instead be CuSn12.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 40,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "ок",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 41,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Good evening, Mateo.\nAttached is the first fully prepared drawing version. Please disregard the current bushing design because I still have not received details on how it should be installed and secured. For the moment, the drawing merely shows it held by 7 screws.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 42,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Good afternoon, Mateo. Do you have any corrections, comments, or additional requests at this stage, and is everything clear so far? Please also let me know when I should expect your feedback.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 43,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The review and clarification work is currently underway. Hopefully, I’ll get back to you next Wednesday with all the clarifications. Thanks for your patience.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 44,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "👍",
        "milestone": null
      }
    ]
  },
